--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d1eb87bd1c28cd449acda7359981c29c, type: 3}
  m_Name: FirstEncounter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueChunk
  lines:
  - text: "I\u2019ll go notify everyone that you 3 are here."
    correctID: 8
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 120f42762d3f4ea4981d34094468ca07, type: 2}
  - text: "See you guys soon\u2026"
    correctID: 8
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 120f42762d3f4ea4981d34094468ca07, type: 2}
  - text: "Alright, I guess we\u2019ll just wait here\u2026"
    correctID: 4
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75c0eb1ef0dab4d4ca5c75fc22c311e7, type: 2}
  - text: "Hey, so\u2026 we just wanted to say that we\u2019re sorry that we had
      to meet again under these circumstances\u2026\r\n "
    correctID: 1
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1eb5066007f0b34fbbbca8d77b047e1, type: 2}
  - text: "Eh\u2026 it's not your fault\u2026"
    correctID: 4
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75c0eb1ef0dab4d4ca5c75fc22c311e7, type: 2}
  - text: And its not yours eith-
    correctID: 2
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b941eaeefd6c7445ab899bb478c0b17, type: 2}
  - text: "Wait\u2026 you\u2019re both floating?"
    correctID: 4
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75c0eb1ef0dab4d4ca5c75fc22c311e7, type: 2}
  - text: "E is the only one who can do that, besides me, of course\u2026"
    correctID: 4
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75c0eb1ef0dab4d4ca5c75fc22c311e7, type: 2}
  - text: "Well you see\u2026 me and the other 2 are members of Protagon."
    correctID: 1
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1eb5066007f0b34fbbbca8d77b047e1, type: 2}
  - text: "Anarchon\u2019s good counterpart."
    correctID: 1
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1eb5066007f0b34fbbbca8d77b047e1, type: 2}
  - text: "Really? That\u2019s slightly reasurring\u2026"
    correctID: 9
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e483e21e4fe87f43bee9eaa667e41de, type: 2}
  - text: "Yeah\u2026 I\u2019ll try not to let my floating-related PTSD get the better
      of me."
    correctID: 4
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75c0eb1ef0dab4d4ca5c75fc22c311e7, type: 2}
  - text: Anyways, I think we can get ourselves through this!
    correctID: 2
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8b941eaeefd6c7445ab899bb478c0b17, type: 2}
  - text: Bet!
    correctID: 7
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: af2bfbcd725ab7f4fadc71acc959705d, type: 2}
  - text: "Great, he\u2019s already here\u2026 "
    correctID: 5
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c2ae27be18ad00f48b1b34cedd44cf61, type: 2}
  - text: Can you return to the metaphorical shadow realm please?
    correctID: 6
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 51104adc72384c849832afd0a84d79fd, type: 2}
  - text: Wow! Not even a hello or welcome back?
    correctID: 7
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: af2bfbcd725ab7f4fadc71acc959705d, type: 2}
  - text: "Uhhh\u2026 hello\u2026 Can you please leave?"
    correctID: 5
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c2ae27be18ad00f48b1b34cedd44cf61, type: 2}
  - text: "Or what, you\u2019ll have your \u201CPostpone Squad\u201D take on lil
      ol me?"
    correctID: 7
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: af2bfbcd725ab7f4fadc71acc959705d, type: 2}
  - text: Sure, we can practice!
    correctID: 7
    speak: {fileID: 11400000, guid: af2bfbcd725ab7f4fadc71acc959705d, type: 2}
